{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10193","headline":"入睦州分水路忆刘长卿 · 李嘉佑","name":"入睦州分水路忆刘长卿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"北阙忤明主，南方随白云。\n沿洄滩草色，应接海鸥羣。\n建德潮已尽，新安江又分。\n回看严子濑，朗咏谢安文。\n雨过暮山碧，猨吟秋日曛。\n吴洲不可到，刷鬓爲思君。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李嘉佑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10193.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10193","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}